(7761714, 1285918, 16062, '<td valign="top">simple and elegant.  Just the right amount of negative space.  Perfect amount of spill below/behind the ornament.  Wouldn''t surprise me if comments are made about needing a backlight to define the shape, but I like the falloff the way it is.  Very nice light.  I dig this!</td>', 'simple and elegant.  Just the right amount of negative space.  Perfect amount of spill below/behind the ornament.  Wouldn''t surprise me if comments are made about needing a backlight to define the shape, but I like the falloff the way it is.  Very nice light.  I dig this!', '2024-01-05 06:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
